#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.2.3.rst:4
msgid "v4.2.3"
msgstr "v4.2.3"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.2.3.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.2.3 is a small release: a TensorFlow output-scaling fix for uint8/int8 "
"models and an RTC accuracy improvement on the OpenMV Pure Thermal. It "
"introduces **no breaking API changes** — v4.2.2 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v4.2.3 je malo izdanje: ispravak skaliranja TensorFlow izlaza za uint8/int8 "
"modele i poboljšanje točnosti RTC-a na OpenMV Pure Thermal. Ne uvodi "
"**nikakve promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost** — v4.2.2 skripte "
"rade nepromijenjeno."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.2.3.rst:13
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Na ovoj stranici"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.2.3.rst:16
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Istaknuto"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.2.3.rst:18
msgid "**Correct TF output scaling** for uint8/int8 models."
msgstr "**Ispravno skaliranje TF izlaza** za uint8/int8 modele."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.2.3.rst:19
msgid ""
"**OpenMV Pure Thermal** — accurate RTC via the low-speed external "
"oscillator."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV Pure Thermal** — točan RTC putem niskobrzinskog vanjskog "
"oscilatora."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.2.3.rst:21
msgid ""
"**No breaking API changes** — reflash and your v4.2.2 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**Nema promjena API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost** — ponovno flešajte i"
" vaše v4.2.2 skripte rade nepromijenjeno."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.2.3.rst:25
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Ispravci grešaka"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.2.3.rst:27
msgid ""
"Fixed TensorFlow model output scaling for ``uint8`` / ``int8`` output "
"tensors, correcting inference results for affected models."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljeno je skaliranje izlaza TensorFlow modela za ``uint8`` / ``int8`` "
"izlazne tenzore, čime su ispravljeni rezultati zaključivanja za pogođene "
"modele."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.2.3.rst:31
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Podrška za hardver i ploče"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.2.3.rst:33
msgid ""
"**OpenMV Pure Thermal** — enabled the RTC low-speed external (LSE) "
"oscillator for an accurate real-time clock."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV Pure Thermal** — omogućen RTC niskobrzinski vanjski (LSE) oscilator"
" za točan sat stvarnog vremena."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.2.3.rst:37
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.2.3.rst:39
msgid ""
"v4.2.3 introduces **no breaking Python API changes**. Scripts that ran on "
"v4.2.2 run unchanged on v4.2.3 — just reflash the firmware. (Note: models "
"that relied on the previous, incorrect uint8/int8 output scaling will now "
"return correctly-scaled values.)"
msgstr ""
"v4.2.3 ne uvodi **nikakve Python API promjene koje narušavaju "
"kompatibilnost**\\ . Skripte koje su radile na v4.2.2 rade nepromijenjeno na"
" v4.2.3 — samo ponovno flešajte ugrađeni program (firmware). (Napomena: "
"modeli koji su se oslanjali na prethodno, netočno skaliranje uint8/int8 "
"izlaza sada će vraćati ispravno skalirane vrijednosti.)"
